  "slug": "prepare-for-travel",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/4980_prepare-for-travel.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "I want to travel next month, but I haven’t decided where to go yet. My friend thinks the north is fun, but it will be too cold next month. The south is better, neither cold nor hot. When I travel, I want to take fruits, bread, mobile phones, computers, and maps with me. My friend said that I should bring less stuff with me because this is a trip, not a move. But I still want to bring more clothes so that I can wear beautiful clothes and take photos every day."
  ],
  "english_full": "I want to travel next month, but I haven’t decided where to go yet. My friend thinks the north is fun, but it will be too cold next month. The south is better, neither cold nor hot. When I travel, I want to take fruits, bread, mobile phones, computers, and maps with me. My friend said that I should bring less stuff with me because this is a trip, not a move. But I still want to bring more clothes so that I can wear beautiful clothes and take photos every day.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Я жела́ю пое́здить сле́дующий ме́сяц, но я ещё не реши́л, куда́ пое́хать. Мой друг ду́мает, что се́вер — это заба́вно, но в сле́дующем ме́сяце будет сли́шком хо́лодно. Ю́г лу́чше: там ни хо́лодно, ни жа́рко. Когда́ я пое́зжу, я хочу́ взя́ть с со́бой фру́кты, хле́б, моби́льные телефо́ны, компьюте́ры и ка́рты."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Ya zheláyu poézdity sléduyushchiy mésyats, no ya yeshchó ne reshíl, kudá poékhat'. Moy druk dúmayet, chto séver — éto zabávno, no v sléduyushchem mésyatse budet slíshkom kholódno. Yúg lúchshe: tam ni kholódno, ni zhaŕko. Kogdá ya poézhu, ya khochu vzyát' s soboy frúkty, khléb, mobil'nye telefóny, komp'útéry i kárty."
  ],
